{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14270","headline":"奉使至邢州赠李八使君 · 窦牟","name":"奉使至邢州赠李八使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独占龙冈部，深持虎节居。\n尽心敷吏术，含笑掩兵书。\n礼饰华缨重，才牵雅制余。\n茂阴延驿路，温液逗官渠。\n南亩行春罢，西楼待客初。\n瓮头开绿蚁，砧下落红鱼。\n牧伯风流足，輶轩若涩虚。\n今宵铃阁内，醉舞复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}